        {
            "_jp": "雷を集めて 自由に操る妖怪。 どんなに厄介なトラブルも 避雷針のように受け止める。 最近 引き受けすぎて 肩こりが 気になるらしい。",
            "_en": "A monster that collects lightning and freely manipulates it. No matter how troublesome the trouble is, I take it like a lightning rod. It seems like he's been taking on too many jobs lately and he's getting stiff shoulders.",
